  <h2>Build the duration question and process-result report</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="how long had the contractor been waiting when the inspector arrived" data-hint="Begin with How long, move had before the subject, and end with the later past reference event." data-fix="How long had the contractor been waiting when the inspector arrived?" data-success-message="Correct. The duration question moves had before the contractor and anchors the earlier wait to the inspector’s arrival.">
    <h3>Builder 1: ask from the later past point</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Build the complete duration question.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="arrived">arrived</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="been">been</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="How long">How long</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the contractor">the contractor</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="when">when</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="had">had</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="waiting">waiting</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the inspector">the inspector</button></div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div>
    <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the crew had been replacing wiring since monday and had completed forty-six circuits by friday" data-hint="Open the activity period first, join it with and, then report the completed quantity by the later deadline." data-fix="The crew had been replacing wiring since Monday and had completed forty-six circuits by Friday." data-success-message="Correct. The continuous clause foregrounds the weeklong process, while the simple perfect clause reports the completed quantity.">
    <h3>Builder 2: combine process and result</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Build one balanced inspection update.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="by Friday">by Friday</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="had completed">had completed</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="wiring">wiring</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="The crew">The crew</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="and">and</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="forty-six circuits">forty-six circuits</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="since Monday">since Monday</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="had been replacing">had been replacing</button></div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks in order"></div>
